                                "sense_id": "a6b6119f-07c6-3727-90c7-8f485b501109",
                                "text": "And today, with our bewilderingly various profusion of gurus and therapists: never before have we had so many self-proffering fielders of the question. Although we are adept at asking questions, we are not always so good at hearing answers."
